+Java,Optional.orElse,orElse,implemented,Eager payload fallback; never returns the Maybe container.,https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html
+Java,Optional.orElseGet,orElseGet,implemented,Nullary fallback invoked only on absence.,https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html
+Java,Optional.or,orElseOption,implemented,Lazy replacement container; no nested Maybe.,https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html
+Java,Optional.ifPresent / ifPresentOrElse,foldOption / tap,covered_composition,Effects are explicit callbacks; discarded result remains ordinary void/value record.,https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html
+Rust,Option.map / filter / flatten,mapOption / filterOption / flattenOption,implemented,Stored payload type and null value remain explicit.,https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/option/enum.Option.html
+Rust,Option.unwrap_or / unwrap_or_else,orElse / orElseGet,implemented,Returns the chosen value record; caller reads its actual type.,https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/option/enum.Option.html
+Rust,Option.or_else,orElseOption,implemented,"Alternative container, distinct from eager payload fallback.",https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/option/enum.Option.html
+Rust,Option.map_or_else,foldOption,implemented,One lazy branch; no fabricated value for None.,https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/option/enum.Option.html
+Rust,Result.map / map_err,mapResult / mapErr,implemented,Only the selected channel is transformed.,https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/result/enum.Result.html
+Rust,Result.or_else,orElseResult,implemented,"Error continuation returns a Result, not an error payload.",https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/result/enum.Result.html
+Rust,Result.map_or_else,foldResult,implemented,Exactly one branch receives its typed payload.,https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/result/enum.Result.html
+Rust,Result.and_then,bindResult,existing,The existing success-chain operation is reused.,https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/result/enum.Result.html
